### Enterprise RMS - Edge Core POS REST API Scenarios
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@managerPin = 1234

### 1. Health & Edge Node Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. List All Tables
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tables
Accept: application/json

### 3. Fetch Menu (Categories & Products)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/menu
Accept: application/json

### 4. Lock Table (Optimistic Concurrency Control)
# Replace {tableId} with actual table id from list
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tables/{{tableId}}/lock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lockedBy": "Garson-Ahmet-El-Terminali"
}

### 5. Open Table & Generate Active Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tables/{{tableId}}/open
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waiterId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### 6. Add Items to Order with Modifiers
# Replace {orderId} and {productId}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2,
  "modifiers": [
    { "name": "Ekstra Cheddar Peyniri", "extra_price": 25.00 },
    { "name": "Acı Sos", "extra_price": 0.00 }
  ]
}

### 7. Get Order Details (Subtotal, Tax, Grand Total)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Apply 10% Discount (Requires 4-Eye Manager PIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/discount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountType": "PERCENT",
  "amount": 10,
  "managerPin": "{{managerPin}}"
}

### 9. Split Bill - Equal Division (3 People)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/split
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EQUAL",
  "payload": {
    "parts": 3
  }
}

### 10. Split Bill - Item Level (Transfer items)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/split
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "BY_ITEM",
  "payload": {
    "itemSplits": [
      { "itemId": "{{itemId}}", "quantity": 1 }
    ]
  }
}

### 11. Process Partial Cash Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "CASH",
  "amount": 250.00
}

### 12. Process Remaining Credit Card Payment (Settles Order & Sets Table DIRTY)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "transactionReference": "POS-PROV-123456"
}

### 13. Clean Table (Transition DIRTY -> AVAILABLE)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tables/{{tableId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 14. Print Customer Bill Receipt (ESC/POS Raw TCP 9100)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/printer/receipt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "openDrawer": true
}

### 15. Print Kitchen Station Ticket (GRILL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/printer/kitchen
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "station": "GRILL"
}

### 16. Trigger Cash Drawer Kick Signal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/printer/drawer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "managerPin": "{{managerPin}}"
}

### 17. Inspect Printer Offline Queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/printer/queue
Accept: application/json

### 18. View Cryptographic Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/logs?limit=20
Accept: application/json

### 19. Verify SHA-256 Audit Trail Integrity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/verify
Accept: application/json
